---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Multilingual Family Support | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover how Marietta Childcare supports multilingual families with language development and cultural sensitivity.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Multilingual support" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Multilingual Family Support</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Language development and cultural sensitivity support for multilingual families.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Multilingual Family Support at Marietta Childcare</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare welcomes multilingual families and celebrates linguistic diversity. Marietta Childcare's multilingual approach supports language development and cultural identity.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Language Development Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare supports children's development in multiple languages. Language development at Marietta Childcare includes English and home language support. Marietta Childcare's approach recognizes the value of bilingual development.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff works with families to support home language maintenance. Language support at Marietta Childcare includes strategies for bilingual development. Marietta Childcare's commitment to language development benefits multilingual children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cultural Sensitivity and Inclusion</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare demonstrates cultural sensitivity and inclusion. Cultural inclusion at Marietta Childcare celebrates diverse backgrounds and traditions. Marietta Childcare's environment welcomes all families and cultures.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's curriculum includes diverse cultural perspectives and experiences. Cultural activities at Marietta Childcare celebrate families' heritages. Marietta Childcare's inclusive approach supports children's cultural identity.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Diverse Community Environment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare creates a diverse community environment. Diversity at Marietta Childcare includes children and families from various backgrounds. Marietta Childcare's diverse community enriches all children's learning.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's environment celebrates differences and promotes acceptance. Community at Marietta Childcare includes multilingual families and diverse perspectives. Marietta Childcare's diversity strengthens the learning environment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Communication with Multilingual Families</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare communicates effectively with multilingual families. Communication at Marietta Childcare includes translation services when needed. Marietta Childcare's staff works to bridge language barriers.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides information in families' home languages. Communication at Marietta Childcare ensures all families understand policies and procedures. Marietta Childcare's commitment to communication supports all families.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Home Language Maintenance</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare supports children's home language maintenance. Home language support at Marietta Childcare includes strategies for bilingual development. Marietta Childcare encourages families to maintain home languages.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's approach recognizes the cognitive benefits of bilingualism. Support at Marietta Childcare includes resources for home language development. Marietta Childcare's commitment to home language strengthens children's development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cultural Celebrations and Activities</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare celebrates diverse cultural holidays and traditions. Cultural celebrations at Marietta Childcare include families' important observances. Marietta Childcare's activities honor diverse cultural backgrounds.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare includes cultural activities throughout the year. Activities at Marietta Childcare teach children about diverse cultures and traditions. Marietta Childcare's cultural programming enriches all children's learning.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Staff Diversity and Training</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare employs diverse staff members. Staff diversity at Marietta Childcare includes multilingual educators. Marietta Childcare's diverse staff reflects the families served.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff receives cultural competency training. Training at Marietta Childcare includes supporting multilingual learners. Marietta Childcare's staff expertise supports multilingual families.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Family Engagement and Partnership</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare engages multilingual families as partners. Family engagement at Marietta Childcare includes sharing cultural knowledge and traditions. Marietta Childcare's partnership approach values families' expertise.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare invites families to share cultural traditions and languages. Engagement at Marietta Childcare includes family participation in cultural activities. Marietta Childcare's collaborative approach strengthens family connections.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Welcome Multilingual Families</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes multilingual families and celebrates linguistic diversity. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn about multilingual support and cultural inclusion.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
